      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Maybe for world game mechanics but then again it can be forced now in the recent beta update through udon.\n\nI've never seen an issue with the avatar scaling provided from community made prefabs nor heard of anyone having issues with people scaling frequently. Rate limiting people when changing clothing on avatars would have to fall into that category which tick off a lot of people. If someone is scaling a lot just hide there avatar or block them.\n\nI understand your view on it though but personally I do not think it is necessary.",
