  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Rate limit how often a new scale can be locked in. This would reduce social disruption from those users who would be constantly changing size.\n\nThe purpose of the scale feature is for users to easily match view points, or better accomodate to worlds designed for scales vastly different to their avatar' base scale. Thus there is no need for rapid scale changing.",
